78    0.120\n\n  Key per-question result:\n  - Q1 (dosage): dense finds the correct chunk at rank 4 (R@10 = 1.0);\n    BM25 fails at top-10 because the aggregated DCI chunk is very long.\n  - Q2 (ibuprofen + aspirin): all methods fail at top-10 due to the synonym\n    gap (aspirine vs ACIDE ACETYLSALICYLIQUE; ibuprofene vs AINS).\n  - Q3 (mission): hybrid is best, 3 of 4 gold chunks in top-10\n    (R@10 = 0.75, nDCG = 0.36), versus 0.25 for BM25 and 0 for dense.\n    Hybrid top-3 are the AINS + antihypertensive interaction chunks plus\n    the amlodipine nomenclature chunk.\n  - Q3f (focused): hybrid places a relevant chunk at rank 1 (MRR = 1.0).\n  - Q5 (out of scope): all methods return random but confident-looking\n    chunks; an abstention threshold is needed.\n\n8. NEGATIVE RESULT\n------------------\n- Added French stemming (PyStemmer) to BM25. It degraded performance\n  (Recall@10 0.125 -> 0.062) because \"associer\" and \"association\" collapse\n  to \"associ\" and flood the long query. The change was reverted and\n  PyStemmer removed from requirements.\n\n9. FILES CREATED / MODIFIED\n---------------------------\nCreated:\n- src/pharmeazor/corpus.py\n- src/pharmeazor/embeddings.py\n- src/pharmeazor/index.py\n- src/pharmeazor/retrieval.py\n- src/pharmeazor/evaluation.py\n- scripts/07_build_corpus.py\n- scripts/08_build_index.py\n- scripts/09_eval_retrieval.py\n- data/processed/week_2/corpus.jsonl\n- data/processed/week_2/retrieval_comparison.md\n- db/index/ (faiss.index, chunk_ids.json, bm25/)\n- docs/week_2/rapport_vendredi.md\n\nModified:\n- scripts/05_clean_thesaurus.py (parser rewrite)\n- src/pharmeazor/config.py (paths + embedding model)\n- requirements.txt (retrieval dependencies)\n\n10. REPRODUCIBILITY\n-------------------\n.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts\\05_clean_thesaurus.py\n.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts\\07_build_corpus.py\n.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts\\08_build_index.py\n.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts\\09_eval_retrieval.py\n\n11